{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/89d8326b78c2315160dee7d68c92792e.avif?t=1764230562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras_big/89d8326b78c2315160dee7d68c92792e.webp?t=1764230562 width=1560 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fabulous Fool</strong> blends solitaire-style card logic with roguelite deckbuilding, creating a fast-paced experience built on the classic depth of the genre.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Build your strategy one card at a time.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect powerful relics, unleash eccentric demons, and craft bizarre, rule-breaking synergies that twist the game\u2019s logic and turn every fight in your favor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Playtest content available:</i></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60 unique demon cards </strong>that mark, empower, alter, copy, weaken, and let you manipulate your cards in countless ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50 relics and consumables</strong> that shape your build, swing impossible fights, and give you the tools to turn defeat into triumph. No winning run goes without them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>16 enemies and bosses.</strong> Each foe fights with its own logic, modifiers, and unfair tricks. Learn their rules\u2026 then turn those rules against them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 event characters</strong> who may reward you, deceive you, or challenge you to a sudden fight \u2014 high-risk encounters that can either empower your build or completely derail it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 complete Acts,</strong> each featuring its own map, enemy roster, event characters, and signature encounters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/87353b592bb64bba62e435e1d4dc2d0a.poster.avif?t=1764230562\" width=1170 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/87353b592bb64bba62e435e1d4dc2d0a.webm?t=1764230562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/87353b592bb64bba62e435e1d4dc2d0a.mp4?t=1764230562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Unlock new cards, demons, and relics with every completed run \u2014 success or failure, each attempt expands your arsenal.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Every journey offers new picks, new synergies, and new surprises.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/caa98d27ed516a9bbd6b987cd4bf719e.avif?t=1764230562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras_big/caa98d27ed516a9bbd6b987cd4bf719e.webp?t=1764230562 width=1560 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Island of Fools \u2014 a strange land where every inhabitant follows the crooked logic of a twisted card game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive here, you must master the rules, bend them, break them, and outplay everyone who stands in your way\u2026 all the way up to the enigmatic King of Fools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the uniquely absurd world of Fabulous Fool, where the rules twist, the island shifts, and nothing stays ordinary.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Enjoy a distinct, fully original art style \u2014 colorful, expressive, and crafted exclusively for this game.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/a1c7f98fb264dcae5d62652c6365a9b2.poster.avif?t=1764230562\" width=1170 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/a1c7f98fb264dcae5d62652c6365a9b2.webm?t=1764230562\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/a1c7f98fb264dcae5d62652c6365a9b2.mp4?t=1764230562\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/2359384a3ec1c977be99754da4f3bb86.avif?t=1764230562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras_big/2359384a3ec1c977be99754da4f3bb86.webp?t=1764230562 width=1560 height=231 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3960170?t=1764230562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/b361e68a2750842f17751d1ee8d31ef77089e2ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764230562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/462e8486e3d372521685bfa5e9b16fc08dcaacf1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764230562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/462e8486e3d372521685bfa5e9b16fc08dcaacf1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764230562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960170/extras/89d8326b78c2315160dee7d68c92792e.avif?t=1764230562\" data-big-src=https://shared.akama